**X Copy**

Option 1: Built a new project called Is This Real. Paste a tweet or mention the bot and it returns a credibility signal, confidence score, and reasoning trail. It combines deterministic rules with LLM judgment and keeps review history so the system can improve over time.

Option 2: Working on an open tweet credibility checker: website plus X bot, hybrid rules plus LLM analysis, and an audit trail instead of black-box answers. The goal is not to declare absolute truth, but to flag likely true, suspicious, or unclear posts with explainable signals.

Option 3: Shipping the first version of Is This Real. It analyzes tweets through a shared backend, shows why a post looks suspicious or unclear, and keeps reviewer history for better future judgments. Still early, but the repo is designed to be inspectable instead of magic.

